
### Create a new partner
POST http://localhost:8000/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Nordwind Solutions Kft.",
    "tax_number": "26481937-2-43",
    "country_code": "HU",
    "email": "info@nordwind.example",
    "address": "Budapest, Hungary"
}


### Test validation errors
POST http://localhost:8000/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "tax_number": "12345",
    "country_code": "HUN",
    "email": "not-an-email"
}


### Update an existing partner
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/partners/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "finance@nordwind.example",
    "address": "Kecskemét, Hungary"
}


### Create a temporary test partner
POST http://localhost:8000/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Temporary Test Partner",
    "country_code": "HU"
}

### Delete the temporary test partner
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/partners/3
Accept: application/json
